{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "ואתם תהיו לי ממלכת כהנים", :translit "v'atem tihyu li mamlechet kohanim", :gloss "and you shall be to me a kingdom of priests"} {:he "ואתם כהני ה' תקראו", :translit "v'atem kohanei Hashem tikare'u", :gloss "and you shall be called priests of the LORD"}], :mechanisms [], :frame {:text "Had Israel merited fully at Sinai, the entire nation would have attained the spiritual rank of High Priests (Exodus 19:6). This elevated status will be restored in the future era, as promised: 'You shall be called priests of the LORD' (Isaiah 61:6).", :sources ["Isaiah 61:6"]}} {:quotes [{:he "וגוי קדוש", :translit "v'goy kadosh", :gloss "and a holy nation"} {:he "וגוי לא ידעוך אליך ירוצו", :translit "v'goy lo yeda'ukha elekha yarutz", :gloss "and a nation that knew you not shall run to you"} {:he "וגוי גרול יעור מירכתי ארץ", :translit "v'goy garul ya'ur miyrkhot aretz", :gloss "and a fierce nation shall be stirred from the ends of the earth"} {:he "וגוי גדול ומלכים רבים יערו מירכתי ארץ", :translit "v'goy gad u'm'lachim rabim ya'aru miyrkhot aretz", :gloss "and a great nation and many kings shall be stirred from the ends of the earth"} {:he "וגוי קדוש", :translit "v'goy kadosh", :gloss "and a holy nation"} {:he "וגוי לא ידעוך אליך ירוצו", :translit "v'goy lo yeda'ukha elekha yarutz", :gloss "and a nation that knew you not shall run to you"} {:he "גוי גדול יעור", :translit "goy gadol ya'ur", :gloss "a great nation shall be stirred"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 4, :occurrences ["וגוי קדוש" "וגוי לא ידעוך אליך ירוצו" "וגוי גרול יעור מירכתי ארץ" "וגוי גדול ומלכים רבים יערו מירכתי ארץ"]}], :frame {:text "If Israel fulfills its calling as 'a holy nation' (Exodus 19:6), then gentile nations will be drawn to God — 'a nation that knew you not shall run to you' (Isaiah 55:5). If not, the consequence is subjugation by hostile foreign powers: 'a fierce nation shall be stirred from the ends of the earth' (Deuteronomy 28:49–50), and in